## Conventions

- Edit `baml_src/{{ project_name }}.baml` to change prompts, models, or output schemas.
- Run `baml generate` after any `.baml` change to regenerate `baml_client/`.
- `baml_client/` is auto-generated — never edit it directly.
- Structured JSON logging only. No `print()` statements in agent code.

## Build & Test

```bash
uv sync
baml generate             # regenerate client after .baml changes
uv run pytest
uv run python evals/runner.py
```

## Deploy

```bash
databricks bundle deploy --target dev
databricks bundle deploy --target prod
```
